 "kind": "statement",
 "title": "Property of the base-changed compactification",
 "statement": "Let $S$ be quasi-compact and quasi-separated and let $Y\\to S$ be\nseparated and of finite presentation. The constructed\n$\\mathsf C^{\\mathrm{fp}}(Y/S)$ of\n[def-nagata-final-basechanged-compactification] is a compactification of\n$Y\\to S$; in particular $Y\\to S$ is compactifiable.",
 "source": {
  "document": "literature/blueprint/master/blueprint/sec-nagata-compactification/sk-cor-nagata-sketch-fp/lemma-nagata-final-basechanged-compactification.md",
